        <headline>Wind Advisory issued September 25 at 3:15AM EDT until September 27 at 6:00AM EDT by NWS Mount Holly NJ</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...North winds 15 to 25 mph with gusts up to 45 mph expected.

* WHERE...Portions of central and northern Delaware, central,
northern, and southern New Jersey, and southeast Pennsylvania.

* WHEN...From 6 PM this evening to 6 AM EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree
limbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result.
</description>
        <instruction>Winds this strong can make driving difficult, especially for high
profile vehicles. Use extra caution.

Secure outdoor objects.</instruction>
